// endpoint_list_workspace_transcripts.proto — ListWorkspaceTranscripts.
// SIDEBAR section. Every vendor conversation that exists for a workspace's
// directory, so a person can choose which one the workspace runs.
//
// A WORKSPACE IS BOUND TO ONE CONVERSATION, and until this verb the binding
// was whatever the workspace happened to start with: a directory can hold many
// conversations — every `/clear` files a new one, and a CLI run outside
// agent-repl files its own — and only one of them was reachable.
//
// PULL, NOT PUSH. The answer is a list a person reads once while choosing;
// nothing about it belongs on a standing stream, and a transcript set changes
// only when a conversation is started or cleared.
//
// IT COSTS NOTHING TO ASK. The shim reads the transcripts' own lines; no query
// is started and no model is called.

